# World 7 does not exist at G2: Book II's Beginner list ends after 6-2, so Flow ends the run (the credits). The flow
# stops there; tools/autoplay/campaign_b2.flow (the full skeleton) takes over once phase 3 adds worlds 7-9.
wait 120
expect game.book == 2
expect events.player_died == 0
shot after_w6_l2
